{
 "about": "Film emulation recipes built only from Thatcher Freeman's utility-dctls (blessdog/utility-dctls @ 693bf81), following its README pipeline: Clamp 0+, Film Curve negative, printer-lights gain holding 0.18, Film Curve print, display encoding by Resolve colour management. Setting names are the DCTLs' own UI names. 'solve' is filled by film_chain.solve_gain. Writer: the agent, from measured renders and Ryan's verdicts. Reader: dctl_film_mini.py.",
