  "rich-halation-grain-400": {
   "why": "rich-halation-grain with 400 grains per pixel instead of 100, for Ryan's 'lower the grain strength' (2026-09-12). Film Grain samples each layer's grain count from Normal(np, np(1-p)), so grain noise scales with 1/sqrt(grains) and the mean tone does not change: 400 leaves half of the grain measured at 100 (fine-detail std 7.4 vs 0.75 without grain).",
